    ^Bcleanup attribute^b

        Extension supported by ^Iclang^i and ^IGCC^i. This attribute allows a
        function to be run when a local variable goes out of scope. The
        attribute takes the identifier of a function with a parameter type that
        is a pointer to the type with the attribute.

        ^T#define defer(F) __attribute__((cleanup(F)))^t
